{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202180","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1220218001:1":{"text":"ルカさん、ちょうどよかったです。バーテンダーさんから聞いたのですが……","source_cn":"卢卡先生，你来的正好。酒保先生说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC4F3B65F92FE161","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1220218002:0":{"text":"さっきまでの出来事をルカに話した……","source_cn":"把刚才发生的事告诉了卢卡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1B3FA2EC52C02B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220218003:1":{"text":"あいつらめ！俺がこらしめてやる！二度とバカなマネをしないようにな！","source_cn":"那几个蠢货，我会教训他们的，不会让他们再闹笑话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17070E394D59E3A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220218004:0":{"text":"でもこらしめたところで、根本的な問題の解決にはなりませんよね？","source_cn":"但就算这样也没法阻止他们喝酒吧，这个问题的本质原因，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF02937923057DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220218005:0":{"text":"水の供給不足は街がまだ解放されたばかりだからですか？それとも浄水管が故障でも？","source_cn":"是因为锈锚港刚刚解封吗？还是净水管道出了故障呢？。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA6D38EBFCF7E855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220218006:0":{"text":"主な原因は浄水管の老朽化だ。生活水はなんとかまかなえているが、飲み水用の浄水が不足している。","source_cn":"主要是净水管道老化，日常供水勉强能用，但是用来喝的净水...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26174E5CACEEBD13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220218007:0":{"text":"実は、上等な浄水システムを作れる職人を探しているんだが――","source_cn":"其实，我正打算找个工匠升级一下净水系统——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1442AE93A442F191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220218008:0":{"text":"職人？フーキンさんは凄腕の職人のはず……","source_cn":"工匠？呼金不就是最好的工匠吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x258377988B8A0C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1220218008":{"text":"職人？フーキンさんは凄腕の職人のはず……","source_cn":"工匠？呼金不就是最好的工匠吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x258377988B8A0C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220218009:1":{"text":"さっそくフーキンさんのところに聞きに行こう！","source_cn":"问问呼金不就知道了？我们去找他吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE935065ECE1FA99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220218010:1":{"text":"でも、ろ過システムが、フーキンさ